  "dct_title_s": "Zebra Distribution: Kenya, 1994-1996",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This polygon shapefile portrays the spatial distribution of zebra numbers observed in Kenya from 1994 to 1996. Wildlife counts came from a rangeland census using low altitude flights. Animals are aggregated to squares of 5 kilometers by 5 kilometers.",
    "This data was used in Map 6.2 in Nature's Benefits in Kenya: An Atlas of Ecosystems and Human Well-Being."
  ],
